start":114,"end":116,"surface":"尹佚","kind":"person","person_id":"mo4_tlr_3fh","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"季紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定個人、群體或氏族稱謂；不推造個別姓名與成員數目。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0186","start":186,"end":188,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p018","text":"封商紂子祿父殷之餘民。武王為殷初定未集，乃使其弟管叔鮮、蔡叔度相祿父治殷。已而命召公釋箕子之囚。命畢公釋百姓之囚，表商容之閭。命南宮括散鹿臺之財，發鉅橋之粟，以振貧弱萌隸。命南宮括、史佚展九鼎保玉。命閎夭封比干之墓。命宗祝享祠于軍。乃罷兵西歸。行狩，記政事，作《武成》。封諸侯，班賜宗彝，作《分殷之器物》。武王追思先聖王，乃褒封神農之後於焦，黃帝之後於祝，帝堯之後於薊，帝舜之後於陳，大禹之後於杞。於是封功臣謀士，而師尚父為首封。封尚父於營丘，曰齊。封弟周公旦於曲阜，曰魯。封召公奭於燕。封弟叔鮮于管，弟叔度於蔡。餘各以次受封。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"商紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"祿父","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7_A","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"管叔鮮","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AB","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"蔡叔度","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AC","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"祿父","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_a